# 复制为 .env 后填入（也可以在看板「设置 → 服务商」里粘贴，只写进这个文件）。.env 在 .gitignore 里，不会被提交。
# Copy to .env and fill in (or paste keys in the web UI: Settings → Providers; they are written only to this file).
# 只填你手头有的那家即可；没填 key 的厂商会被跳过。自己加的服务商用自己起的变量名，同样写在这里。
# Fill in only the vendors you have; vendors without a key are skipped.

DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# OpenRouter 聚合网关（OpenAI 兼容协议）/ OpenRouter aggregator (OpenAI-compatible)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# 可选：交付用的 GitHub 令牌（老写法）。建议改在看板「设置 → 连接」里配（支持 GitHub App、按人的令牌）；这里填的作为最后一档兜底
# Optional: GitHub token for delivery (legacy). Prefer Settings → Connections on the board (GitHub App, per-person tokens); this one is the last fallback
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# 部署级通知通道（可空；个人通道在「设置 → 成员」里挂）。webhook URL 含密钥，日志只记种类与主机名。
# Deployment-wide notification channels (optional). Webhook URLs contain secrets; only kind + host are logged.
NTFY_URL=
FEISHU_WEBHOOK=
DINGTALK_WEBHOOK=
WECOM_WEBHOOK=
NOTIFY_CMD=

# 可选：邮件。SMTP_URL 与 MAIL_FROM 都填了才发信（成员自己登记的邮箱也靠这两项）；MAIL_TO 是部署级收件邮箱，可空。
# Optional: email. Mail is sent only when both SMTP_URL and MAIL_FROM are set (members' own addresses depend on them too); MAIL_TO is the deployment-wide address and may be empty.
#   smtps://用户:密码@smtp.example.com:465   直接 TLS / direct TLS
#   smtp://用户:密码@smtp.example.com:587    STARTTLS（服务器不支持就不发 / nothing is sent if the server lacks it）
#   smtp://127.0.0.1:25                      本机中继，只有本机地址允许明文 / local relay; plain text only for local addresses
#   用户名、密码里的 @ : / 写成 %40 %3A %2F / write @ : / in user names and passwords as %40 %3A %2F
# SMTP_URL=
# MAIL_FROM=SuperIntern <si@example.com>
# MAIL_TO=

# 可选：邮件答复（直接回推送邮件就算答复）。先配好上面的发信，再填收信的 IMAP_URL；守护进程每分钟收一次没读过的信（收完标已读，不删）。
# Optional: reply by email (replying to a push email counts as an answer). Set up sending above first, then IMAP_URL for receiving; the daemon fetches unread mail once a minute (marked read, never deleted).
#   imaps://用户:密码@imap.example.com:993   直接 TLS；文件夹默认 INBOX，换文件夹写在路径上：imaps://…/Replies / direct TLS; folder INBOX by default, another one goes in the path
#   imap://用户:密码@imap.example.com:143    STARTTLS（服务器不支持就不收 / nothing is fetched if the server lacks it）
# 回信寄到 MAIL_REPLY_TO（没填就是 MAIL_FROM），这个地址的信要能在 IMAP_URL 的邮箱里收到。邮箱支持加号别名就写成 reply+{token}@example.com。
# Replies go to MAIL_REPLY_TO (MAIL_FROM if empty), and mail to it must arrive in the IMAP_URL mailbox. With plus addressing, write reply+{token}@example.com.
# IMAP_URL=
# MAIL_REPLY_TO=

# Total time limit for one model call, in milliseconds; a timeout is retried as a network failure. Default 1800000 (30 minutes), enough for the longest normal generation. Raise it only for a very slow self-hosted gateway.
SUPERINTERN_LLM_TIMEOUT_MS=
